WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.168
Welcome to the course: Boosting

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.460
Efficiency With Microsoft Copilot

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.224
This extensive course on Microsoft Copilot, your

00:00:10.224 --> 00:00:13.032
AI-driven assistant is aimed at boosting

00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:16.219
productivity and creativity in professional settings,

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.896
It's structured to enable you to

00:00:18.896 --> 00:00:21.688
fully harness the capabilities of Copilot.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.448
It offers an in-depth exploration

00:00:23.448 --> 00:00:26.606
of its features, functionalities, and practical

00:00:26.606 --> 00:00:30.070
applications within Microsoft 365 tools.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.966
From automating tedious tasks in Excel to

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:37.038
producing refined documents in Word, optimizing communication

00:00:37.038 --> 00:00:40.130
Outlook, and fostering collaboration in Teams,

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:45.170
Copilot is revolutionizing our work processes.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:48.654
You will discover how its sophisticated features –

00:00:48.654 --> 00:00:52.344
such as natural language comprehension, content creation,

00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:56.808
and data analysis – can streamline intricate workflows,

00:00:56.808 --> 00:00:59.440
minimize errors, and allow for more time

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:02.160
dedicated to strategic planning.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:05.752
In this course, you will: Describe generative AI

00:01:05.752 --> 00:01:09.368
and Copilot State the key features of Copilot

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:12.600
And explain the best practices for using Copilot